sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Person as Browser user
    participant API as Correct host API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Person->>API: Submit email and password
    API->>API: Validate origin, input, and request limits
    API->>DB: Read saved account
    DB-->>API: Account role and password hash
    API->>API: Verify password and login role
    alt Invalid request or credentials
        API-->>Person: Reject without creating a session
    else Valid credentials and role
        API->>DB: Save session hash, role, and expiry
        API-->>Person: Set protected host-only session cookie
    end
